    },
    {
      "displayText": "Better watch out—there’s a wild Emolga around\nhere that keeps stealing people’s food.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt only goes after its favorite Berries, but still! It’s\na huge nuisance.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This Emolga’s a fast little thing, too. No one’s\nbeen able to catch it...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you’re a big-shot Trainer in the Z-A Royale,\nright?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThink you could battle this Emolga and scare\nsome sense into it?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t mind if you catch it or defeat it—I just want\nit to leave our food alone!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Speaking of, Pecha Berries seem to be this\nEmolga’s favorite. Here—I’ll show you one.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Molgaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006C006700610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wha—?! That puny pest pilfered my Pecha Berry!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800612014003F002100200054006800610074002000700075006E007900200070006500730074002000700069006C006600650072006500640020006D00790020005000650063006800610020004200650072007200790021001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chase after that Emolga, would you? You should\nbe able to catch up to it using Roto-Glide!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
