    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heh! Looks like that pesky Emolga was no match\nfor you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006800210020004C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B0065002000740068006100740020007000650073006B007900200045006D006F006C0067006100200077006100730020006E006F0020006D0061007400630068000A0066006F007200200079006F00750021001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And it left behind all my Pecha Berries too!\nThings are finally coming up Urmand!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though I guess Emolga will probably just keep on\npilfering food from other places in the city...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t really blame it. Pokémon and people are all\njust doing what we can to survive, eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Can you let Emolga out of its ball? I’d like to get a\ngood look at our little thief.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mol...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmph. I’ll admit—you’re one tough Emolga! It\ncan’t have been easy surviving in this city.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure Emolga didn’t think it was doing\nanything wrong. It was just gathering food.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPokémon and people aren’t so different in that\nrespect. We’re all doing what we can to get by.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
